{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And a goat.</b> To atone for 'they slaughtered a goat' in the sale of Joseph. <b>For a sin-offering to YHWH</b> — because it is the first [sacrifice] in which 'to YHWH' is written, [teaching] that it should be for the sake of Heaven, and so all of them." "<b>Upon the elevation-offering.</b> With the elevation-offering." "<b>Upon the elevation-offering of the daily offering it is done and its libation.</b> Pair it with the elevation-offering of the daily offering and its libation — the sin-offering is done along with the daily offering." "<b>And its libation.</b> Refers to the wine libations and the meal-offering libations of the daily elevation-offering."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:03.939629894Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}